WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:17.014
"How did you get into my room?"

2
00:00:17.814 --> 00:00:19.555
the young girl in blue asked.

3
00:00:20.895 --> 00:00:21.776
"We're lost.

4
00:00:22.096 --> 00:00:26.658
We're looking for a statue of a woman," Mandy said quickly.

5
00:00:26.678 --> 00:00:32.040
"Lydia, bring Jason," the girl in blue said.

6
00:00:32.852 --> 00:00:34.033
"He'll know what to do."

7
00:00:34.854 --> 00:00:36.715
The other girl bowed and left.

8
00:00:36.735 --> 00:00:39.237
"Is Lydia your friend?"

9
00:00:39.937 --> 00:00:40.838
wondered Mandy.

10
00:00:40.858 --> 00:00:45.401
"No, she is our slave.

11
00:00:46.042 --> 00:00:49.224
Most Greeks have slaves," said the girl.

12
00:00:49.244 --> 00:00:50.785
"Who are you?"

13
00:00:52.106 --> 00:00:54.307
The children introduced themselves.

14
00:00:54.327 --> 00:00:58.370
"My name is Callia," said the girl.

15
00:00:58.971 --> 00:01:00.412
But she did not smile.

16
00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:06.644
"This cloth is very pretty," Mandy said, trying to change the mood.

17
00:01:06.664 --> 00:01:08.446
"Do you weave?"

18
00:01:08.466 --> 00:01:10.408
"Yes, I do.

19
00:01:10.428 --> 00:01:14.511
I am making cloth for my wedding," said Callia.

20
00:01:15.412 --> 00:01:17.153
Her anger was almost gone.

21
00:01:17.173 --> 00:01:20.956
"After the Olympic Games, I will be married."

22
00:01:20.976 --> 00:01:25.020
"Married?" Mandy cried.

23
00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:26.941
"You're so young!"

24
00:01:26.961 --> 00:01:29.704
Now Callia smiled.

25
00:01:30.796 --> 00:01:32.637
"You're not from Athens, are you?

26
00:01:33.138 --> 00:01:35.840
Girls here marry when they are 14 years old."

27
00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:40.823
"Callia!" a boy's voice called.

28
00:01:41.623 --> 00:01:45.226
"Jason!" Callia cried, running to greet him.

29
00:01:46.527 --> 00:01:49.429
Jason was careful not to step into the room.

30
00:01:50.630 --> 00:01:53.392
Callia introduced the children to her brother.

31
00:01:53.412 --> 00:01:59.636
"You are lucky my sister has a good heart," said Jason.

32
00:02:00.556 --> 00:02:02.417
"Father will not hear about this.

33
00:02:03.517 --> 00:02:05.818
This room is only for women and girls.

34
00:02:06.839 --> 00:02:08.799
Men and boys are not allowed here."

35
00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:13.461
Vinnie quickly moved to stand beside Jason.

36
00:02:13.481 --> 00:02:18.864
"They say they need to find a statue of a woman," said Callia.

37
00:02:21.145 --> 00:02:22.865
Jason burst out laughing.

38
00:02:22.885 --> 00:02:26.087
"Athens has many statues of women!"

39
00:02:26.747 --> 00:02:27.307
he said.

40
00:02:27.327 --> 00:02:29.228
"Can you tell us more?"

41
00:02:30.416 --> 00:02:38.100
"She has a big helmet," said Mandy, "and holds a smaller woman with wings in her right hand."

42
00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:42.583
"Wait, you speak of Athena," said Jason.

43
00:02:42.603 --> 00:02:45.504
"She is the goddess of our city.

44
00:02:46.585 --> 00:02:49.686
That statue is in her temple, the Parthenon.

45
00:02:50.487 --> 00:02:52.348
It is at the top of the Acropolis."

46
00:02:52.368 --> 00:02:55.549
"The Parthenon!"

47
00:02:56.090 --> 00:02:57.010
cried Mandy.

48
00:02:57.030 --> 00:03:00.072
"I'll take you there," said Jason.

49
00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:03.722
"But I am going to the gymnasium first."

50
00:03:03.742 --> 00:03:07.705
"Thank you," said Vinnie and Mandy.

51
00:03:10.147 --> 00:03:12.829
The children followed Jason through the house.

52
00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:16.312
The home was built around a courtyard.

53
00:03:17.913 --> 00:03:20.635
Mandy noticed a kitchen and a workshop.

54
00:03:21.716 --> 00:03:23.457
People were coming and going.

55
00:03:25.679 --> 00:03:26.980
One room had couches.

56
00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:31.423
Some people carried small barrels into this room.

57
00:03:33.025 --> 00:03:35.667
One person carried what looked like a flute.

58
00:03:36.868 --> 00:03:39.971
"We hold symposia there," Jason said.

59
00:03:39.991 --> 00:03:42.233
"No girls allowed."

60
00:03:42.893 --> 00:03:44.174
He smiled at Vinnie.

61
00:03:44.195 --> 00:03:47.578
"Symposia are dinner parties.

62
00:03:48.659 --> 00:03:49.719
We eat and drink.

63
00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:52.082
We discuss many important things."

64
00:03:53.163 --> 00:03:54.564
Jason winked at Vinnie.

65
00:03:55.377 --> 00:03:57.744
"Of course, we have a lot of fun too!"
